    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/electrostore/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "ElectroStore is a responsive eCommerce WordPress theme that comes with various great features and is designed for an electronics store. ElectroStore is a powerful and fully customizable theme, which means you can customize and change almost every element of the theme. The theme has a built-in custom homepage that will help you quickly customize and enable the homepage of your site. You just need to enable this feature on the theme settings page. The custom homepage comes with several beautiful and well-designed sections. The free version of ElectroStore includes Banner section, Call to Action section, and Latest Posts section while the premium version comes with even more sections such as a WooCommerce Products section, Sales section, Advantages section, and other sections. All these sections allow you to customize the main page of your site very easily and quickly. You just need to change the default texts and links and a beautiful homepage is ready. WordPress electronics store theme is integrated with WooCommerce and has many options that allow you to customize the layout and design of your store pages. You can control almost every element of your store page directly from the ElectroStore theme settings page. You can change the style of the primary button, add a sidebar and search bar for shop/product pages, add breadcrumbs, change the layout dimensions of shop/product pages, change the header cart settings, and much more. Another advantage of the WordPress electronics store theme is fully customizable banners for different types of pages (post, page, blog/archive, search). You can change the background and text color of banners, add breadcrumbs, and banner animation. Our theme also allows you to have full control over your blog/archive page. You can change the layout and design of your blog/archive page. You can change the position of the sidebar or simply hide it, change the metadata and other colors of the post list, change the background colors, and much more. There is even more you can do with the ElectroStore theme, so you might want to check out the demo first or just install the theme and see it in action."
    },
